Module Name

Match Lobby

Purpose

The Match Lobby enables students to participate in real-time multiplayer quiz competitions. It acts as a centralized area where students can discover, join, and manage different types of matches, including 1v1 Battles, Group Competitions, Tournaments, Timed Challenges, and Cooperative Gameplay.

Objectives
Allow students to browse available matches.
Enable students to join real-time competitions.
Facilitate challenge-based gameplay between students.
Provide live updates regarding participants, rankings, and match status.
Manage matchmaking based on configured competition rules.
User Roles
Student
View available matches.
Create or accept challenge requests.
Join multiplayer competitions.
Participate in tournaments.
View live rankings and results.
Admin
Configure match rules.
Manage tournament settings.
Monitor active matches.
Publish and manage results.
Match Types Supported
1. One-on-One (1v1) Battle

Students can challenge other students directly.

Features
Send challenge requests.
Accept or reject challenge requests.
Select quiz categories and subcategories.
Earn additional reward points for winning.
Flow
Student opens Match Lobby.
Selects "1v1 Battle".
Chooses category/subcategory.
Sends challenge request.
Opponent accepts challenge.
Match begins.
Winner receives reward points.
2. Group Competition

Multiple students compete simultaneously.

Features
Join open competitions.
Compete against multiple participants.
Real-time score tracking.
Live ranking updates.
3. Tournament Mode

Students participate in multiple rounds based on predefined tournament rules.

Features
Elimination rounds.
Progression through brackets.
Automatic qualification for next rounds.
Final winner declaration.
4. Timed Challenge

Students attempt quizzes within a fixed duration.

Features
Countdown timer.
Score based on accuracy and completion time.
Leaderboard integration.
5. Cooperative Gameplay

Students work together toward a common objective.

Features
Team participation.
Shared scoring.
Collaborative quiz completion.
