Functional Requirements
Match Discovery

The system shall:

Display available matches.
Display upcoming matches.
Display live matches.
Allow searching by category.
Allow filtering by match type.
Category Selection

The student can:

Select a single category.
Select multiple categories.
Select category and subcategory combinations.
Play quizzes from all categories.
Matchmaking

The system shall:

Match players based on configured rules.
Validate participant eligibility.
Allocate players to appropriate competitions.
Real-Time Gameplay

The system shall:

Display live opponent movement.
Display real-time score updates.
Display live rankings.
Synchronize match progress across participants.
Connection Handling

The system shall:

Detect player disconnection.
Support player reconnection.
Restore active session state.
Results Management

The system shall:

Publish match results after completion.
Update leaderboards automatically.
Award reward points.
Store match history.
